===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|télémètre||device used for measuring distance}} coined by [[w:Selligue|Selligue]] from {{confix|fr|télé-|-mètre|nocat=1}}, possibly from a blend of [[télescope]] and [[micromètre]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any measuring [[device]] used in [[telemetry]].
# A device used for [[rangefinding]], especially of military targets.
